    "A 5K block is specific enough to feel motivating, but still realistic for your current base.": {},
    "A family member has a compatible easy run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un familiar tiene una carrera suave compatible con la tuya."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有家人的轻松跑训练与你相配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few more saved activities will unlock stronger trends.": {},
    "A moment worth noticing": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un momento que vale la pena destacar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值得留意的一刻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real endurance build with bigger long-run expectations.": {},
    "A short easy run keeps the rhythm without forcing the full workout.": {},
    "A short reset is enough.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un breve reinicio es suficiente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "短暂调整一下就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short, comfortable start is enough to learn from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un comienzo corto y cómodo basta para aprender."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次短暂、舒服的开始，就足以让我们有所了解。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small session still moves the day forward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una sesión pequeña también hace avanzar el día."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "短暂的训练也能让今天向前一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A starting estimate is enough. Your runs will make it more accurate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una estimación inicial es suficiente. Tus carreras ayudarán a mejorarla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初步估计就足够了。你的跑步会让它更加准确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %lld min on weekdays": {
