    "You already have a base. A 5K block can sharpen it without needing a heavy schedule.": {},
    "You always choose whether to use a gentler option or keep the planned workout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siempre eliges si utilizar una opción más suave o mantener el entrenamiento planificado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以随时选择更轻松的方案，也可以保留原定训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are building something steady.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estás construyendo una buena constancia."
          }
        },
