          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You came back before it felt perfect. That's real momentum.": {},
    "You can also shake your iPhone anywhere in the app to report a bug or share a suggestion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "También puedes agitar tu iPhone en cualquier parte de la aplicación para informar un error o compartir una sugerencia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你也可以在应用中的任何页面摇动 iPhone，报告问题或提出建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You completed this week’s rhythm.": {},
    "You completed today’s %@ activity. Let that work count and prioritize recovery now.": {},
    "You covered this week's core work. Anything extra can stay easy.": {},
    "You didn't wait for a bigger window. You used the one you had.": {},
    "You do not need a big day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No necesitas hacer un gran día."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天不必做太多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You do not need a perfect session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No necesitas una sesión perfecta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不需要一次完美的训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You followed through on the week you were trying to build.": {},
    "You followed through. Let that win be enough for today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cumpliste. Deja que ese logro sea suficiente por hoy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你完成了今天的训练。好好享受这份成就感。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You gave the week a clean finish instead of letting it drift.": {},
    "You have a solid rhythm going this week.": {},
    "You have enough baseline to start a half build, but the plan still needs to stay grounded in your current routine.": {},
    "You kept the effort honest. That kind of restraint builds trust.": {},
    "You kept the pattern alive long enough for it to feel like rhythm.": {},
    "You kept the promise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cumpliste contigo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你兑现了对自己的承诺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a beginning. Your companion can take it from there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo necesitas empezar. Tu compañero te ayudará con el resto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你只需要迈出第一步，剩下的交给跑步伙伴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a real one. Something small still counts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesitas una sesión real. Algo pequeño también cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来一次踏实的训练，哪怕很短也算数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You turned the first session into something real.": {},
    "You've built enough baseline work that a longer endurance focus can be realistic if the week stays controlled.": {},
